/// ### What it does
/// Checks for manual case-insensitive ASCII comparison.
///
/// ### Why is this bad?
/// The `eq_ignore_ascii_case` method is faster because it does not allocate
/// memory for the new strings, and it is more readable.
///
/// ### Example
